From 16388e38e715c9b8f40327ed260f52d52a540a5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rinehart <johnrichardrinehart@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:43:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Let each Overview action narrow its output scope

Preserve the existing all-output Overview behavior while adding an all-outputs
property that bindings can disable to target only the active output. Keep
hot-corner and gesture entry points unchanged.

Constraint: Existing Overview bindings must retain global multi-output behavior
Rejected: Default all-outputs to false | silently changes every existing Overview action on multi-output setups
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Every path writing monitor Overview progress must honor overview_output
Tested: Action parser and multi-output render regressions; wiki parsing; workspace Clippy with warnings denied
Not-tested: Packaged build and live three-output interaction after this revision
